WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.991
Unit twenty-two. A Clean Home!

2
00:00:03.944 --> 00:00:07.704
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.754 --> 00:00:11.288
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:14.874
Today we learn about A Clean Home. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:18.923
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

6
00:00:22.435 --> 00:00:25.802
Sweep. Say it with me. Sweep!

7
00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:32.818
Rubbish. Say it with me. Rubbish!

8
00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.569
Bin. Say it with me. Bin!

9
00:00:43.072 --> 00:00:46.405
Tidy. Say it with me. Tidy!

10
00:00:49.926 --> 00:00:53.226
Dust. Say it with me. Dust!

11
00:00:56.725 --> 00:01:00.125
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

12
00:01:03.624 --> 00:01:06.907
Home. Say it with me. Home!

13
00:01:10.413 --> 00:01:18.349
I help keep my home clean. I sweep the floor, tidy my toys, and put rubbish in the bin. A clean home has fewer germs and less dust.

14
00:01:18.399 --> 00:01:19.628
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.012 --> 00:01:26.446
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.496 --> 00:01:27.646
Rubbish!

17
00:01:28.475 --> 00:01:33.721
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.771 --> 00:01:34.921
Germs!

19
00:01:35.811 --> 00:01:41.855
Did you know? Putting rubbish in a covered bin keeps flies and rats away from your home!

20
00:01:41.905 --> 00:01:43.919
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.642 --> 00:01:52.026
Think and answer. How do you help keep your home clean?

22
00:01:52.076 --> 00:01:53.226
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:58.961
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.011 --> 00:02:01.497
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

